  "tone": "Contemplative and luminous, with a sense of divine glory breaking into ordinary life; quiet intimacy in dialogue scenes and tension in conflict scenes.",
  "depiction_rules": [
   "Depict Jesus as a Jewish man of the 1st century, not with the halo-and-blue-robe stereotype of later art unless the illustration calls for it.",
   "Show the divine voice from the sky and the angels in white as light rather than as human figures where possible.",
   "Handle the crucifixion with restraint, avoiding gratuitous gore while keeping its weight.",
   "Do not depict God the Father in human form.",
